{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hi everyone. this is 'Of Lies and Rain' demo!<br><br>This preview offers you the chance to explore the game\u2019s opening level, should be about an hour of  gameplay. It\u2019s the perfect way in our opinion to get a feel for the experience and decide if it\u2019s worth your money before the full release.<br><br>Please keep in mind that we\u2019re a small, dedicated team of just five people, and this is only our second game ever. Over the past two years, we\u2019ve poured our hearts and souls into crafting this adventure, and we\u2019re aiming for a 2025 launch.<br><br>We\u2019re not locking in an exact release date yet, our goal is to polish every detail as much as we can. Once it\u2019s ready, we\u2019ll announce the official release.<br><br>Enjoy the demo, and thanks for joining us on this journey!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3629230?t=1747234829","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629230/6d3e27e97ac751d00bf69dafefdd8f5144fe38b7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747234829","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629230/4b536db14984dc4579af8fab3572bd63f6c73140/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747234829","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629230/4b536db14984dc4579af8fab3572bd63f6c73140/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747234829","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"We wanted to depict a post-apocaliptyc, devastated world where humanity is collapsing. A world like this is a violent one. People are drawn to cannibilism and Violence against each other in order to survive. There is no explicit sexual content in \"Of Lies and Rain\"."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_para